        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 065, Mortise Traditional Beaded Turnpiece Privacy Bolt For Bedroom and Bathroom Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 065 Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Simple hobnail styling around the edge of this solid brass door lever grants this Omnia made latchset a glamor without being gaudy. Mortise privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Bolt (Bathroom and Bedroom):</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 065 Classic Beaded Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height (both interior and exterior): 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width (both interior and exterior): 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 9/16\" throw solid brass bolt</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-nickel-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Beaded Turnpiece Mortise Privacy Bolt",
                "description": "Omnia 065 Traditional Turnpiece Privacy Bolt - Omnia's 065 Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Simple hobnail styling around the edge of this solid brass door lever grants this Omnia made latchset a glamor without being gaudy. Mortise privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "OMN-065, omnia 065, omnia 065/238, omnia 065/234, omnia 065 privacy bolts, omnia traditional turnpiece privacy bolts, bedroom privacy bolts, bathroom privacy bolts, traditional privacy bolts, solid brass privacy bolts, privacy locks, classic privacy bolts, traditional privacy door bolts, omnia beaded turnpiece privacy bolts, omnia beaded privacy bolts,"
